# Easy Write — Project Conventions

macOS 26+ menu-bar app (`LSUIElement`, no Dock icon), Swift 6 toolchain in Swift 5 language mode, built with Swift Package Manager. One executable target, `EasyWrite`. Entry point: `Sources/EasyWrite/main.swift` → `AppDelegate`.

Translation runs on Apple's on-device Foundation Models. Requires Apple Silicon and Apple Intelligence at runtime.

